# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore, which is close but not the same thing: the
# build context only needs what the Dockerfile copies. Uploading the venv, node_modules and the
# evidence videos makes every deploy slower for no benefit.
#
# Note this does not override .dockerignore; both apply, at different stages.

.git
.gitignore

# Python environments and caches
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Frontend: deployed separately to Vercel, not part of this image
frontend

# Local runtime artifacts
backend/storage
backend/models

# Evidence, docs and tooling: not needed to run the service
EVIDENCE
scripts
*.md

# Never
.env
.env.*
